  "content": "{section: Verso 1}\n[E]Have a drink they're [G]buying\n[E]Bottom of, bottle of [G]denial\n\n{section: Refrão 1}\n[D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [E5]Big guy,... big eye,... watching me...\n[D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [E5]Have to wonder what it sees...\n\n[D5] [C5]Progress... [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5]laced with... [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5]ramifications...\n[D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [E5]Freedom's big plunge\n\n{section: Refrão 2}\n[D7]Pull the innocent from a [Am7]crowd\n[Am7]Raise the sticks then bring them [A]down\n[Cadd9] [A]If they fail to obey... [Cadd9] [E]if they fail to obey\n\n[E] [G] (x2)\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[E]For every tool they lend us... [G]a loss of independence [E] [G]\n\n{section: Refrão 3}\n[G5] [F#5] [E5] [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [E]I pledge my grievance to the flag\n[G5] [F#5] [E5] [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [E]Because you don't give blood... to take it back again\n[G5] [F#5] [G5] [A5] [B5] [C5] [E] [G]Oh we're all deserving something more\n\n{section: Refrão 1}\n[D5] [C5]Progress,... [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5]taste it,... [D5] [C5]invest-it-all\n[D5] [C5]Champagne breakfast for [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5]everyone\n\n{section: Refrão 2}\n[D7]Break the innocent when they're [Am7]proud...\n[Am7]Raise the stakes,... then bring em [A]down...\n[Cadd9] [A]If they fail to obey... [Cadd9] [E]if they fail to obey\n\n{section: Refrão 3}\n[G5] [F#5] [E5] [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [E]I pledge my grievance to the flag\n[G5] [F#5] [E5] [D5] [C5] [D5] [C5] [E]Because you don't give blood... to take it back again\n[G5] [F#5] [G5] [A5] [B5] [C5] [E] [G]Oh we're all deserving something more\n\n[E] [G] (x4)\n[E] [D/F#]\n[C] [A] (x2)\n\n{section: Outro}\n[E]I want to breathe [D/F#]\n[C]Follow the scene [A]\n[E]I want to taste [D/F#]\n[C]Everyone I see [A]\n[E]I want to run when I'm up high [D/F#]\n[C]I want to run into the sea [A]\n[E] [D/F#] [C] [A]I only want life.... to be...\n[E] [D/F#] [C] [A]I just want to be...\n[E] [D/F#] [C] [A]I will feel alive... as long as I am free..."
